{"step_index":82,"source":"USER_EXPLICIT","type":"USER_INPUT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-24T18:22:29Z","content":"<USER_REQUEST>\nSYSTEM: Output ONLY executable, ultra-fast Python 3.10+ code. Zero preamble, zero conversational commentary. Write `src/evidence_indexer.py`.\r\n\r\nTASK:\r\nWrite a zero-token local evidence indexer that parses all files in `dataset/evidence/logs/` and `dataset/evidence/records/` and loads their extracted facts into SQLite `cache/northstar.db`.\r\n\r\nINPUT SCHEMAS:\r\n1. JSON Line Logs (e.g. `structured_service_events_*.log`):\r\n   Format: `<TIMESTAMP> <JSON_OBJECT>`\r\n   Fields of interest:\r\n   - `service`: system_id (e.g., \"account_service\", \"security_service\")\r\n   - `resource_id`: resource identifier (e.g., \"account_3960\", \"audit_record_4902\")\r\n   - `event`: event name (e.g., \"profile_lookup_completed\", \"audit_record_read_completed\")\r\n   - `rows`: \"0\" -> ABSENT, \"1\" -> PRESENT\r\n   - `http_status`: 404 -> ABSENT, 200 -> PRESENT\r\n\r\n2. Key-Value Logs (e.g. `resource_lookup_trace_*.log`):\r\n   Format: `<TIMESTAMP> level=<LEVEL> service=<SERVICE> trace_id=<TRACE> event=<EVENT> resource_id=<ID> [customer_reference=null email=null ...]`\r\n   Fields of interest:\r\n   - `service`: system_id (e.g., \"analytics_platform\")\r\n   - `resource_id`: resource identifier (e.g., \"analytics_9406\")\r\n   - State rule: if `customer_reference=null` and `email=null` -> state is ANONYMIZED.\r\n\r\n3. Structured JSON Records (e.g. `customer_analytics_report_*.json`):\r\n   Format: JSON array of objects or dict of items.\r\n   Fields:\r\n   - `resource_id`: e.g. \"analytics_901\"\r\n   - `user_id`, `email`, `phone`, `email_hash`: if all null/None -> state is ANONYMIZED.\r\n\r\nINDEXER SPECIFICATION:\r\nCreate a single function:\r\n`index_unstructured_evidence(evidence_dir: Path = Path(\"dataset/evidence\"), conn: sqlite3.Connection = None) -> None`\r\n\r\n1. Create a SQLite table in `conn`:\r\n   ```sql\r\n   CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS evidence_records (\r\n       file_id TEXT,\r\n       captured_at TEXT,\r\n       system_id TEXT,\r\n       resource_id TEXT PRIMARY KEY,\r\n       verified_state TEXT,       -- 'ABSENT', 'PRESENT', 'ANONYMIZED', 'REDACTED'\r\n       user_id TEXT,\r\n       email TEXT\r\n   );\r\n   CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_ev_res ON evidence_records(resource_id);\r\n   CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_ev_user ON evidence_records(user_id);\r\n   CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_ev_email ON evidence_records(email);\n</USER_REQUEST>\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-24T23:52:29+05:30.\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>"}
